  <div class="container global-primary  ">
    <div class="container-md-height" style="height: 100%; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 2%; "> <!-- height and width must be difined for td to size correctly -->
      <div class="row row-md-height" style="height: 100%;">
        <!-- Rendering page grid items -->
        <div id="page-item-599449d26ef2d44ce300087f"
             class="item grid-text-item
              col-xs-12
              col-md-12
              col-md-height
              "
             style="vertical-align: top; height: 100%;">
          <div style="height: 100%;">
            <div class="box-info " style="">
                <!-- Redner grid item partial -->
                <!-- Redner grid item title -->
                  <div class="title" ng-non-bindable><p><span style="font-size:18px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(57, 62, 72); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">WHO WE ARE?</span></strong></span></p></div>
                <!-- Redner grid item content -->
                  <div class="description" ng-non-bindable><div>
<p style="color: rgb(41, 37, 44); font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>WHO WE ARE</strong></span><br>
<span style="font-size: 16px;">Welcome to ozDigitalWatch, one of Australia’s largest specialist online watch retailer of genuine watch. Based in Sydney, we take pride in offering an extensive range of Casio<a href="https://www.ozdigitalwatch.com/categories/casio-watch" target="_blank"><span>&nbsp;</span></a>(<a href="https://www.ozdigitalwatch.com/categories/casio-watch" target="_blank"><span>Casio General</span></a>, <a href="https://www.ozdigitalwatch.com/categories/casio-gshock-men-watch" target="_blank"><span>G-Shock</span></a>, <a href="https://www.ozdigitalwatch.com/categories/baby-g" target="_blank"><span>Baby-G</span></a>, <a href="https://www.ozdigitalwatch.com/categories/protrek" target="_blank"><span>ProTrek</span></a>) and Seiko. All our products are 100% authenticity with high quality.</span><br>
<br>
<strong><span style="font-size: 16px;">Our Promise</span></strong><br>
<span style="font-size: 16px;">At ozDigitalWatch.com.au, we are committed to providing our customers with the latest and most popular Seiko and Casio watches at highly discounted prices compare to official retail prices.</span><br>
<br>
<span style="font-size: 16px;">We are dedicated to delivering exceptional customer service. Our friendly team is always ready to assist you with any queries you may have. Plus, with our full warranties, you can shop with confidence.</span><br>
<br>
<strong><span style="font-size: 16px;">Stay Updated</span></strong><br>
<span style="font-size: 16px;">Our product range is constantly growing, with new items added each week. To ensure you never miss out on our latest products and exclusive deals, we offer a free newsletter service. Sign up to receive updates on new arrivals, free shipping offers, discount coupons, and other great promotions.</span><br>
<br>
<span style="font-size: 16px;">Experience the convenience of online shopping with ozDigitalWatch and find the perfect watch for you today. Enjoy our competitive prices, fast local shipping, and exceptional customer service.</span></p>

<hr style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 37, 44); font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
<p style="color: rgb(41, 37, 44); font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-size: 16px;">WHY ozDigitalWatch</strong></p>

<p style="color: rgb(41, 37, 44); font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 16px;">At ozDigitalWatch.com, we take pride in being an Australian-owned and operated online store. Our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction sets us apart. Here’s why you should choose us:</span></p>

<ul style="color: rgb(41, 37, 44); font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
	<li>
	<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Authenticity Guaranteed</strong>: All our products are 100% genuine and brand new</span></p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Ready Stock</strong>: We hold our stock locally, ensuring that your order is dispatched within 24 hours of purchase.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Fast and Safe Delivery</strong>: We offer quick, reliable delivery through Australia Post or Courier, complete with online tracking and signature delivery service.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Customer Satisfaction</strong>: Your satisfaction is our top priority. We offer a 100% Customer Satisfaction Guarantee and a 30-day money-back guarantee on all our products.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Secure Shopping</strong>: Our online store provides safe shopping with 256-bit encrypted SSL by PayPal and a secure payment gateway. Additionally, Paypal offer a Buyer Protection Policy for added security.</span></p>
	</li>
</ul>

